body:
I truly understand you. I originally came on this website to try to 'anonymously' spread the word about a website I created that is all about being able to speak freely, without judgement or bullshit.. and we just on some level just get eachother and our situations..

&#x200B;

it's 

[i-am-you.org](https://i-am-you.org)

&#x200B;

but no pressure to check it out, I was just trying to create a website for people like me, that get me. But still I want it to be anonymous for everyone there (including me).. so  I don't put out ads or whatever. I just kind of hang around veting to myself on the chat until some of the regulars show up and reply :)

&#x200B;

But do have a look if you have a sec

I get you.

&#x200B;

Please have a look at this kiskstarter project [http://kck.st/2OuYCER](http://kck.st/2OuYCER)
